{"unit_id":"svgop__dsh-rich-questions#card-zh","repo":"svgop/dsh-rich-questions","commit":"da2e619187418e8aba61673ebecf2b5012e51e75","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rich-questions 是 DSH Web 的分支问卷插件。agent 可通过 ask_survey 创建问卷，用户在聊天输入区逐题作答；答案会决定后续问题。支持多选、自由文本、跳题、快速模板，以及逐步构建和检查草稿。选项可附带洞察、来源和 Mermaid 流程图。适用于需求澄清与结构化决策收集。需要 Node.js 20 及以上；展开流程图时从 jsDelivr 加载 Mermaid。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:510","src/host.js:710","src/client.bundle.js:890","src/client.bundle.js:1115","src/client.bundle.js:678"]}
{"unit_id":"svgop__dsh-rich-questions#card-en","repo":"svgop/dsh-rich-questions","commit":"da2e619187418e8aba61673ebecf2b5012e51e75","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-rich-questions adds branching surveys to DSH Web. Agents create surveys with ask_survey; users answer in a chat wizard where choices determine follow-up questions. It supports multi-select, free text, quick templates, staged drafts, and option insights with Mermaid diagrams. Needs Node.js 20+.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:510","src/host.js:710","src/client.bundle.js:890","src/client.bundle.js:1115","src/client.bundle.js:678"]}
