{"unit_id":"svgop__dsh-rich-questions#feature-1","repo":"svgop/dsh-rich-questions","commit":"da2e619187418e8aba61673ebecf2b5012e51e75","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rich-questions 的功能「分支问卷」：agent 通过 ask_survey 提交问题图，用户按逐题向导回答，已选选项可决定接下来的问题路径。支持单选或多选、自由文本和跳过问题。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:510","src/survey-engine.js:47","src/client.bundle.js:890"]}
